Package: collision-guard-visual-debugger
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Collision Guard Tool Maintainers <ops@example.com>
Depends: python3, sudo, systemd, xdg-utils
Description: Visualization and debugging tool for collision guard systems
 A local web-based panel for visualizing, debugging, controlling, and editing
 a configured set of collision guard related systemd services on an industrial PC.
